[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 23641.35, "timestamp": "06:34:01", "text": "溪流。给自己留个D，好让我吃块饼干。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23645.15, "timestamp": "06:34:05", "text": "什么？你好，欢迎来到直播间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23647.23, "timestamp": "06:34:07", "text": "随机生成器。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23650.11, "timestamp": "06:34:10", "text": "你好。好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23652.708, "timestamp": "06:34:12", "text": "晚上。好的，我还有大概十个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23654.99, "timestamp": "06:34:14", "text": "几分钟后我就得走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23657.19, "timestamp": "06:34:17", "text": "去某个地方参加会议，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23660.868, "timestamp": "06:34:20", "text": "东西。所以，我会让你穿上V。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23665.27, "timestamp": "06:34:25", "text": "我大概一两个小时后就回来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23668.548, "timestamp": "06:34:28", "text": "另外，我还有音乐课要上。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23672.07, "timestamp": "06:34:32", "text": "嗯，大概两个小时吧。患病的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23675.99, "timestamp": "06:34:35", "text": "稍后回来。 8 之前是 8 吗？我会在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23679.11, "timestamp": "06:34:39", "text": "好了，我们继续刚才的事情。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 23681.948, "timestamp": "06:34:41", "text": "动画组缩放"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 23693.205, "timestamp": "06:34:53", "author": "@ionomyself", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/rj_4etD1zl9z355fBAbotBRNwdzb6hGprkYR7TbRFVqfRFUl3t50cJ8SM4OG2lVzupX6oBYi3w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Say my name"}]